# ASTRID source catalog for GBT-26B-012 (Salt in Sgr B2N)
# Coordinates J2000; velocities LSR-kinematic radio, km/s.
#
# Map center is SgrB2M (changed from SgrB2N 2026-11-17).  The 6'x6' OTF map
# centered here encompasses SgrB2M, SgrB2N (46" N) and G0.693-0.027 (1.7' N).
# SgrB2M keeps VEL = 64.0 (as SgrB2N) so the Doppler tracking and the VEGAS
# window placement are unchanged.  SgrB2N stays defined so SBs that name it
# still run.  G0.693 is a note only - not a target.
#G0.693             17:47:21.86  -28:21:27.3  68.0
format=spherical
coordmode=J2000
veldef=vrad-lsr
HEAD = NAME        RA           DEC          VEL
SgrB2M             17:47:20.16  -28:23:04.5  64.0
SgrB2N             17:47:19.87  -28:22:18.4  64.0
